// Oil counters ([CR#122.1] counters in general — a Kaladesh-block named
// counter with no CR-mandated automatic behavior of its own): a MARKER
// counter, like `AgeCounter`/`ChargeCounter`. Every card effect that cares
// reads its count directly (`CounterCount(This, OilCounter)`) or spends it via
// an activated ability's own cost/effect.
CounterKind(
    name: "oilCounter",
    params: [],
    spelling: "oil",
    grammar: FixedTerm(surface: "oil"),
    body: Counter(kind: Named(label: "Oil"), holder: Object, confers: []),
)
